+
+No `principalId` field is permitted in the projection.
+
+## 3.3 Edge interface
+
+```ts
+export interface MemoryObservatoryEdge {
+  edgeId: string;
+  fromMemoryId: string;
+  toMemoryId: string;
+  relation: MemoryRelation;
+  weight: number;
+  evidenceEventId?: string;
+}
+```
+
+`edgeId` is deterministically derived from `fromMemoryId + relation + toMemoryId`, not from random browser state.
+
+## 3.4 Activity interface
+
+```ts
+export interface MemoryObservatoryActivity {
+  sequence: number;
+  timestamp: string;
+  category: 'memory' | 'continuity' | 'tool' | 'execution' | 'routing' | 'remote' | 'http' | 'system';
+  event: string;
+  state?: 'started' | 'completed' | 'failed' | 'pending';
+  requestId?: string;
+  traceId?: string;
+  routeContextId?: string;
+  toolName?: string;
+  runId?: string;
+  executionNodeId?: string;
+  memoryIds?: string[];
+  relation?: MemoryRelation;
+  decisionType?: MemoryPersistenceDecisionType;
+  reasonCodes?: string[];
+  statusCode?: string;
+  durationMs?: number;
+}
+```
+
+The activity projector uses a whitelist. It must not pass arbitrary `AuditJournalRecord.data` to the browser.
