+# 6. Real-Time Event Semantics
+
+Events exist for observability; they do not define memory truth.
+
+## Preflight
+
+```text
+memory.preflight_started
+memory.preflight_completed
+memory.recalled
+```
+
+`memory.recalled` safe payload:
+
+```json
+{
+  "memoryIds": ["A5", "A4"],
+  "reasonCodes": ["CURRENT_REVISION_MATCH", "PRIOR_FAILURE_MATCH"],
+  "state": "completed"
+}
+```
+
+No raw task prompt.
+
+## Remember More
+
+```text
+memory.remember_more_started
+memory.remember_more_expanded
+```
+
+Safe payload includes source/target IDs, reason, depth, relation path names, count, and duration; no hidden reasoning.
+
+## Postflight
+
+```text
+memory.write_decision
+memory.node_created
+memory.revision_created
+memory.edge_created
+memory.conflict_opened
+memory.postflight_completed
+```
+
+Every `memory.node_created` must correlate to a persisted decision/provenance record.
+
+## Remote Durability
+
+```text
+memory.remote_pending
+memory.remote_synced
+memory.hydration_started
+memory.hydration_completed
+memory.hydration_failed
+```
+
+Remote events may show generation ID/logical-state hash because those are verification metadata, but must never show Git credentials or encryption key material.
+
+---
+
+# 7. Graph Consistency Strategy
+
+Do not make the browser maintain an independent authoritative graph.
+
+Correct flow:
+
+```text
+memory mutation transaction commits
+        ↓
+safe observer event emitted
+        ↓
+AuditJournal persists event
+        ↓
+SSE notifies browser
+        ↓
+browser highlights activity immediately
+        ↓
+if graph-changing event:
+  debounce 50 ms
+        ↓
+fetch authoritative snapshot
+        ↓
+replace graph projection
+```
+
+This deliberately prefers correctness over a clever client-side patch protocol for v1.
+
+Later optimization may introduce bounded graph deltas only after snapshot-based convergence is certified.
+
+---
+
+# 8. Shadow Validation Matrix
+
+The minimum test corpus must include all of these patterns:
+
+```text
+A. linear evolution
+A1 continues A2 supersedes A3
+
+B. failure chain
+Failure → caused_by → Cause → resolved_by → Solution → validated_by → Evidence
+
+C. revise
+same node, revision N → N+1
+
+D. branch
+parent → branch_of child
+
+E. fresh root
+new root + FRESH_DURABLE_CONTEXT/rootReason
+
+F. conflict
+A contradicts B, both preserved
+
+G. remember_more
+initial A4/A5; bounded expansion reveals A2/A3
+
+H. no-write
+NO_DURABLE_MEMORY creates ledger event but zero semantic nodes
+
+I. remote pending/synced
+visible state transitions
+
+J. restart
+same graph after Agent Core restart
+
+K. cross-Codespace deletion recovery
+same logical graph after fresh hydration
+```
+
+For every scenario, compare three views:
+
+```text
+DMF authoritative rows
+Audit/write-decision/recall-expansion evidence
+Observatory projection/UI
+```
+
+All three must agree on observable truth.
+
