+
+Example observable flow:
+
+```text
+USER TASK RECEIVED
+        │
+        ▼
+RIGHT TRACKER
+memory.preflight_started
+        │
+        ▼
+LEFT GRAPH
+A5 ● RECALLED CURRENT
+A4 ● RELATED SOLUTION
+        │
+        ▼
+RIGHT TRACKER
+memory.remember_more_started
+memory.remember_more_expanded
+        │
+        ▼
+LEFT GRAPH
+A3 ● PRIOR FAILURE
+A2 ● PRIOR DECISION
+        │
+        ▼
+RIGHT TRACKER
+tool/file/test activity
+        │
+        ▼
+RIGHT TRACKER
+memory.write_decision: REVISE_EXISTING
+        │
+        ▼
+LEFT GRAPH
+A5 revision 4 → 5
+        │
+        ▼
+RIGHT TRACKER
+memory.edge_created: validated_by
+memory.remote_pending
+memory.remote_synced
